# Written to the CLI's cwd by a headless PredBat instance before annual_cli.py's --work-dir
# takes effect (create_headless_predbat() sets config_root only after load_user_config()/
# fetch_config_options() have already run) - so running the documented annual_cli.py command
# from the repo root leaves this behind.
